<title>USA: Health Care files $300 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>Health Care files $300 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Care REIT Inc said Wednesday it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $300 million in debt securities, preferred and common stock and warrants.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used to finance company investments in health care facilities and will allow the company to pursue additional health care property investments and complete unfunded commitments.</p>
<p>The Toledo, Ohio, company is a self-administered real estate investment trust that invests in health care facilities, primarily nursing homes, assisted living centers and retirement centers.</p>
